// Tiles follow the filter, so they can never disagree with the list underneath them.
// renderBar() deliberately does NOT - a marked item hidden by a filter still has to
// execute, and narrowing it to what is on screen would silently drop decisions the
// user made before they filtered. Do not "fix" the bar to match these.
function ofTotal(v,t){return String(v)===String(t)?String(t)
  :v+'<span class="of"> of '+t+'</span>'}
